{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-01-25 11:35:00', 'title': 'TRUIST DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE ON MAR. 1, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEB. 11, 2022.'}